STARTFONT 2.1
COMMENT /*
COMMENT  * SurfOS symbols 8x16, 10/6/26
COMMENT  * Copyright (c) 2026, Brandon Burr
COMMENT  *
COMMENT  * The code page 437 characters the console needs that Spleen 8x16
COMMENT  * (spleen-8x16.bdf next to this file) does not have, drawn for SurfOS
COMMENT  * in Spleen's manner: SurfOS's breadcrumb triangle and wave (the prompt,
COMMENT  * shell/prompt.c), and the pointer and right angle at 0x11 and 0x1C.
COMMENT  * tools/bdf2c.py takes a glyph from here only where Spleen has none.
COMMENT  *
COMMENT  * U+25B8 a small solid triangle: Spleen's triangles are steps of two
COMMENT  *        pixels in the x-height band (rows 5-11); this one is 5x5 in
COMMENT  *        rows 6-10, so it sits on the same centre row as the letters.
COMMENT  * U+224B three of the tildes of Spleen's U+2248, three rows apart,
COMMENT  *        centred where = and > are (rows 3-10).
COMMENT  * U+25C4 Spleen's U+25B2 turned to point left (rows 5-11).
COMMENT  * U+221F the right angle in the rows of Spleen's U+2310 and U+00AC.
COMMENT  *
COMMENT  * Released under the BSD 2-Clause license, the same terms as Spleen
COMMENT  * (LICENSE-spleen in this directory, with this copyright line), so the
COMMENT  * table generated from both fonts, driver/font8x16.c, has one license.
COMMENT  *
COMMENT  * SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause
COMMENT  */
FONT -surfos-symbols-medium-r-normal--16-160-72-72-C-80-ISO10646-1
SIZE 16 72 72
FONTBOUNDINGBOX 8 16 0 -4
STARTPROPERTIES 7
FAMILY_NAME "SurfOS Symbols"
WEIGHT_NAME "Medium"
SPACING "C"
FONT_ASCENT 12
FONT_DESCENT 4
COPYRIGHT "Copyright (c) 2026, Brandon Burr"
DEFAULT_CHAR 32
ENDPROPERTIES
CHARS 4
STARTCHAR RIGHT ANGLE
ENCODING 8735
SWIDTH 500 0
DWIDTH 8 0
BBX 8 16 0 -4
BITMAP
00
00
00
00
00
00
C0
C0
C0
FE
00
00
00
00
00
00
ENDCHAR
STARTCHAR TRIPLE TILDE
ENCODING 8779
SWIDTH 500 0
DWIDTH 8 0
BBX 8 16 0 -4
BITMAP
